batil ki zaba par kalma hai<br />
islam ka daai ban ban kar<br />
karta hai kitale ahle sharaf<br />
ae sar game dawar<br />
ae khulq ke paykar<br />
ae muniso yawar</p>

<p>2. Bismil bismil maqtal maqtal<br />
galiyo me chauraho me<br />
fir daure yazidi jari hai<br />
fir jabir aql se aari hai<br />
bechain gharo ke andar hai<br />
aur khauf ibadat gaaho me<br />
bazue payambar<br />
maula e qambar<br />
ai deen ke lashkar</p>

<p>3. Jo ale nabi k hasid ythe<br />
